      "created_at": "2026-03-11T08:38:02.202Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I create a new BOM, using the BOM Creator functionality, the system does not allow me to link operations to the BOM. After completing the BOM, I need to go back to the BOM list, create a new version of the relevant BOM and then add the operation. Is there any way to dd the operation while creating the BOM, using the BOM creator?</p>",
