      "name": "TCB Infotech",
      "created_at": "2026-03-11T16:55:06.801Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We have worked on something similar.<br>\nWhat we did was to customize the BOM Creator’s functionality itself. Stop it from creating submitted BOMs and added custom fields for routing and scrap inside the BOM Creator itself.</p>\n<p>What it produced was BOMs that already had Operations and Scrap and were not submitted so you could still edit them.</p>",
